{title: Koi Na Koi Chahiye}
{artist: Vinod, Rathod}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] Koina koi cha [G] hiye pyar karne [Am] wala,        [Am] Koina koi cha [G] hiye humpe marne [Am] wala
[Am] Dil-o-jaan lutaayenge [G] hum to usi pal,        [Am] Saath mein bitaayenge [G] shyam-o-saher
[Am] Shyaam-o-saher o mere yaara,        [Am] Us chaand ke [G] tukde ko
[Am] Seene se lagaa [G] loonga,        [Am] Us reshmi [G] mukhde ko
[Am] Aankhon mein chhupaa loonga,        [D] Deewana mujhsa na [Am] milega usko
[G] Es zamin se leke sare [Am] asman tak,        [Am] Koi na koi chaa [G] hiye...
[Am] Na meri koi [G] manzil na,        [Am] Mera hai thi [G] kaana
[Am] Maine to yaaron [G] sikha,        [Am] Kaanton se dil lagaana
[D] Ulfat ka main deewana hoon,        [Am] Duniya se main begaana
[G] Baahon mein aasmaan hai,        [Am] Kadmon mein hai zamaana
[Am] Koi na koi chaa [G] hiye...
